      en: "Modriča is a dynamic city in the northern part of Republika Srpska, strategically situated at the edge of the vast and exceptionally fertile Posavina plain. Over many decades, the city has firmly established itself as a decisive industrial powerhouse for the entire country. Modriča gained worldwide recognition primarily through its large and ultra-modern oil refinery, which produces premium-quality lubricants for the international market and serves as the economic backbone of the region. In addition to its thriving heavy industry, agriculture also plays a highly significant role, greatly facilitated by the excellent natural conditions of the Posavina area. The harmonious combination of industrial capability, traditional agricultural practices, and the warm, deeply rooted hospitality of the local population makes Modriča a remarkable and multifaceted regional hub."
