      en: ["Stanari was re-established as an independent municipality in 2014.", "The Stanari Power Plant has an installed capacity of 300 MW.", "The lignite mine produces over 2 million tons of coal annually.", "A major railway junction on the line connecting Doboj and Banja Luka.", "The municipality is named after the Stanari settlement on the Ukrina River.", "The power plant is the first in BH to comply with EU environmental directives."],
